# ⚠️ The staged RECORD is ~130 MB for four pages and is not committable, which
# is the standing state for records in this repo (see
# `benchmarks/omr-cleanup-count-2026-09/.gitignore`). Everything DERIVED from
# it IS committed -- the MusicXML, the system map, the coverage report and the
# grade -- so §9's confirmation can be checked from a checkout, and only
# re-deriving the record itself needs the gather re-run.
out/record-*.json
out/*.log
# Build products: `dump_headers.py` writes the header crops here, and the
# repo's root .gitignore already excludes `benchmarks/**/crops/`.
crops/
